{
  "id": "九天",
  "name": "九天",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "concept",
  "typeConfidence": "high",
  "description": "古说天有九层，故说九天",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "chuci-01-02",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "古说天有九层，故说九天"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "chuci-01-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "患兮，\n\n忍而不能舍也！\n\n指九天以为正兮，\n\n夫唯灵修之故也。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "chuci-02-06",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "兮浩歌。\n\n孔盖兮翠旌,\n\n登九天兮抚彗星。\n\n竦长剑兮拥幼艾,"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "chuci-03-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n八柱何当？\n\n东南何亏？\n\n九天之际,\n\n安放安属？\n\n隅隈多"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-02-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "者也。卓然独立，块然独处；上通九天，下贯九野；员不中规，方不中矩"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-03-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "神之和。若然者，下揆三泉，上寻九天，横廓六合，揲贯万物，此圣人之"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-07-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，然而专精厉意，委务积神，上通九天，激励至精。由此观之，上天之诛"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-18-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "滑淖精微，贯金石，穷至远，放乎九天之上，蟠乎黄卢之下，唯无形者也"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 22,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-22-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "谓言者，齐于众而同于俗，今不称九天之顶，则言黄泉之底，是两末之端"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 24,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-24-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n\n《览冥》者，所以言至精之通九天也，至微之沦无形也，纯粹之入至"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "chuci",
    "chapterIndex": 1
  }
}
